# Machine-specific overrides for workspace `dev`. Gitignored — yours alone.
#
#   cp platform/dev.local.env.example platform/dev.local.env
#
# Anything in platform/dev.env can be overridden here; this file wins, and
# `make platform-pull` never touches it.

# Who may reach admin UIs on the ALB (Argo CD). Comma-separated CIDRs. Unset,
# `make argocd-expose` detects this machine's current public address.
#
# Include the Jenkins Elastic IP: the pipelines read sync and health from the
# Argo CD API at argocd.<site>, and sync prod after an approval. Without it,
# every deploy stage times out waiting for an API it cannot reach.
# ADMIN_ALLOWED_CIDRS=203.0.113.7/32,3.225.171.46/32
